VERSION 1.9.3
-------------------------

  o testEnrichmentSEA: the two tails now share one pooled permutation
    null, so the p-value no longer depends on the sign of the query
    (zhou-lab/knowYourCG#6)
  o testEnrichmentSEA: the sign of estimate is flipped to match GSEA.
    Positive now means the set is enriched at large values, negative at
    small values. Results from earlier versions have the opposite sign.
    KYCG_plotSetEnrichment now walks from the largest value down.

VERSION 0.99.0
-------------------------

  o First submission of knowYourCG package to Bioconductor
